# React Native + Expo

## Theme

Import `@/theme` tokens. Load Plus Jakarta Sans + Be Vietnam Pro via `expo-font`.

## Stitch Component Patterns

- `PrimaryButton`: 4px 3D offset on `primary`/`secondary` only; `ghost`/`text` flat
- `SquareKeypad`: A–H / 1–8 key rows (56px) + selection display + Submit — for `square` puzzles
- `YesNoZone`: split tap halves + swipe (No ← red | green → Yes), directional haptic — for `yes-no` puzzles
- `Card`: flat default (`variant: flat`); `recessed` for settings/options panels
- `ScreenScroll`, `StatCard`, `ScreenState`, `PeekChip`: shared layout primitives
- `ChessBoard`: fluid width minus 40px margins; a–h / 1–8 labels; SVG pieces
- Icons: `components/ui/icons/` — SVG only, **no emoji**

## Performance

Reanimated for press animations. Stockfish WASM + STT off main thread.

## Routes

```
app/                    → Expo Router entry (`index` resumes onboarding at currentOnboardingStep)
  (onboarding)/         → linear flow, gestureEnabled: false
  (main)/               → tabs: Home | Training | Match | Analysis; settings route hidden (header gear)
    analysis/           → stack: list (index) + replay ([matchId])
    training/           → stack: hub (index) + node ([nodeId]) + drill session
screens/onboarding/     → HookBoard, StoryCheck, RewardPuzzle, FogReveal, MatchPrimer
screens/home/           → HomeDashboard (closed-loop)
screens/training/       → TrainingHub, TrainingNode, DailyDrill
screens/match/          → VoiceMatch
screens/analysis/       → MatchHistory, Replay
```

## Structure

```
screens/       → compose components, route params, thin orchestration
components/ui/ → reusable primitives (check here first)
components/*   → domain modules (chess, match, heatmap, replay, home, onboarding, training)
hooks/         → shared stateful logic
stores/        → Zustand + AsyncStorage (guest session)
```

Reuse before creating. Extract when a block repeats across screens/states or a screen grows unwieldy. Do not over-abstract one-off UI.

## State

chess.js owns position. UI state in Zustand. Server state via TanStack Query.

## Training hooks

| Hook | Role |
|------|------|
| `usePuzzleBank` | Optional: load `puzzle_bank` rows for hybrid daily top-up (not required for generators) |
| `useDailySession` | Generated + peek puzzles (+ optional bank); 3 per `todayKey()`; works without bank |
| `useTrainingSessionController` | Daily or node session bootstrap/resume; `completeDailyDrill` or `completeTrainingNode` on finish |
| `useNodePuzzles` | Resolve node puzzles from generators only; stable session key mid-session |
| `useTrainingPath` | Path map units/nodes, active node |
| `useDrillSessionController` | Deprecated wrapper — prefer `useTrainingSessionController` |
| `useProfileSync` | Hydrate `matchElo` from `profiles` — mount once under `(main)` |
| `useResolvedPuzzle` | `resolveTrainingPuzzle` — motif/peek ids only; ranked motif must match `expected` |
| `usePuzzleSessionPhase` | memorize → narrate → answer; `showBoard: false` skips board/peek (coordinate drills); standard-start + moves skips memorize |
| `useMemorizePhase` | 5s board memorize step |
| `useStoryNarration` | Move TTS via `expo-speech` (puzzles with `moves[]`) |
| `useTrainingAnswer` | Validate + heatmap ledger |
| `useDailyMatrix` | Hub/home session puzzle count + peek loop badge + `isCompletedToday` |

Skill: `training-flow`. No separate `StoryPuzzle` screen.

## Match hooks

| Hook | Role |
|------|------|
| `useMatchSession` | chess.js game state, player side, disambiguation, engine reply; `MatchRecorder` event log; persists `MatchRecord` to guest store on finalize |
| `useMatchHistory` | Hydrated `matchHistory` from guest store for offline replay list/detail |
| `useMatchSpeech` | On-device STT — `resolveVoiceTranscript`, confidence-gated auto-submit, auto/manual/hold listen modes |
| `useMatchPeek` | 2s board flash + `recordPeek` on match log (every peek) + `addPeekEvent` (one event per position) + `match_peek` ledger (every peek) |

Engine: `lib/engine/stockfishWorker.ts` — Stockfish 17 at 1320+; human fallback below. Skill: `voice-match`.

## Blueprint

No board pieces during blindfold (except hook/replay/post-game). No voice in training.

## Testing (iOS Simulator MCP)

